Inclusion criteria:
Type 2 diabetes group:
- BMI 25-35 kg/m2 and with a sedentary lifestyle (<150 min/week moderate-intensity exercise); 
- diagnosed as type 2 diabetes ≥ 1 year; 
- prescribed immediate-release metformin twice per day ≥ 3 months

Non-diabetes group:
- BMI 25-35 kg/m2 and with a sedentary lifestyle (<150 min/week moderate-intensity exercise); 
- no diagnosed of type 2 diabetes.
Exclusion criteria:
- insulin treatment within 12 months prior to the start of the study; 
- chronic prescription of other medications; 
- fasting glucose concentrations >16 mmol/L; 
- serious diabetic complications (e.g., nephropathy, retinopathy, and neuropathy); 
- any contraindications for undertaking exercise testing (e.g. acute infectious diseases or chronic inflammation).
